{"product_id":"rainbow-magic-early-read-shannon-ocean","title":"Rainbow Magic Early Read Shannon Ocean","description":"\u003cp\u003eThese cheerful and inviting Early Readers bring the blast of colour that Rainbow Magic's youngest fans have been waiting for!Best friends Rachel and Kirsty are visiting the seaside. But Jack Frost has stolen three enchanted pearls from Shannon the Ocean Fairy. If the girls can't help Shannon, all oceans will be ruined forever!'These stories are magic; they turn children into readers!' ReadingZone.comIf you like Rainbow Magic, check out Daisy Meadows' other Magic Animal Friends and Unicorn Magic!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Daisy Meadows\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408327470\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 80\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898788339865,"sku":"17RE-49781408327470","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69184f9d262e6_Rainbow_Magic_Early_Read_Shannon_Ocean.jpg?v=1763223182","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/rainbow-magic-early-read-shannon-ocean","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}